//! Pokemon Emerald (US) rev 0: every ROM address the importer reads.
//!
//! Generated by `cargo xtask gen-rom-profile --rom <rom>` from the build
//! whose whole-file SHA-1 is `f3ae088181bf583e55daf962a92bb46f4f1d07b7`. 1172 roots, each matched
//! against the pack `cargo xtask extract` produces.
//!
//! 7 roots were chosen among identical copies: each one's bytes repeat at
//! several ROM addresses holding identical data, so the generator pairs the copies off
//! in address order against the ids that share the art and records the
//! one at that position (the lowest address first). The importer reads
//! bytes, so any copy yields the same pack entry. Every other root was
//! settled by a unique byte signature, a struct field, an adjacent root,
//! or a pointer. The roots with duplicate copies:
//! - `sprite/devon_employee`
//! - `sprite/man_2`
//! - `sprite/may/mach_bike`
//! - `bag/item-icon/image/antidote`
//! - `bag/item-icon/image/status_heal`
//! - `opening-scene/palette/bg0`
//! - `opening-scene/palette/bg1`
//!
//! Do not edit by hand. An address here is only trustworthy because a
//! machine derived and checked it; change the generator and regenerate.

